# Manual fighting with two arrows (fixtures/blows: the outside save made
# aggressive, byte 263, 2, and the CD's LBA.CFG). F6's advanced options
# set the fighting to manual, then Space is held with Up and Right. In
# LBA.EXE each frame starts Right's blow, then Up's over it, so that
# Twinsen stands in the first frame of a blow. Started once a frame, Up's
# blow plays and plays again.

sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 12
shot start
key F6
sleep 2
key Down Down Down Return
sleep 2
shot advanced
key Down Return
sleep 1
shot manual
key Up Return
sleep 2
key Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot game
down space Up Right
sleep 3
shot blows
up space Up Right
sleep 2
shot end
